window.products.push({"id":386059,"name":"Eco-Ancheng Recliner Slipcovers 4-Pieces Recliner Chair Covers Lazy Boy Chair Covers Stretch Recliner Couch Covers Fitted Non Slip Reclining Slipcover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7126jfeCZKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great Fit: This 4-piece Eco-Ancheng recliner slipcover is made from luxurious polyester spandex fabric so that it is very stretchable to conforms to your furniture's contours for a custom-look fit. Suitable for manual and electric recliner. Back width 24-33 inches, height 29-37 inches, base width 19-23 inches, side width 26-34 inches, please refer to the measurement drawing before purchase. With pocket and continuous pedal. Note :no hand handle hole, please pay attention before purchase. Multi-Function: Pet protector furniture covers for recliners protect against everyday dirt, sweat, children's play, and even scratches from pets and dogs. Lazy boy recliner sofa covers make the recliner look new and diy chair covers change the decor for the living room. These beautiful slipcovers will extend the life of your recliners, save you money, and give your old furniture a new look. Quickly and easily update the color or fabric of existing furniture. Non-slip Design:Our 4-pieces lazy boy recliner chair covers with arms include up back, footrest, right and left arm sofa slipcovers. Each section has elastic bands, and thick elastic rings are sewn into the bottom edge to make the covers stay in place. Side pocket design, you can put your glasses, remote control or any small items on slide pocket for easy access. Easy To Install: Install in a few minutes, recliner slipcover with high elasticity fabric and clear introductory label,you only need to find the corresponding label,and check the picture installation guide carefully to install for your recliner.Stretchy recliner seat covers secure on the recliner easily like wear a glove. Easy Care: Machine washable for easy care and maintenance, keep fresh look after many times washing. Separately in cold water on the gentle cycle, do not use bleach. Shopping more fit slipcovers styles in Eco-Ancheng shop for your sofa, club, chair, recliner, wing chair, ottoman, dining chair and futon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7126jfeCZKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eco-Ancheng","source_asin":"B0BXP9GRB7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-386059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXP9GRB7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXP9GRB7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
