window.products.push({"id":386070,"name":"King Cooling Mattress Topper, Pillow-Top Optimum Thickness, Soft 100% Cotton Fabric, Breathable & Plush Quilted Down-Like Fill, Snug Deep Pocket fit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lX3ZOOmpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ MATTRESS TOPPER FOR OPTIMUM THICKNESS, SUPPORT & COMFORT: Whether your bed room mattress is too firm or you need pillow top softness, our 300 TC 100% cotton king mattress topper can solve your woes. Neither too thick or thin, our white mattress topper king size alleviates pressure points i.e. neck & back pain when you sleep. The baffle box construction keeps the feathers from shifting around. It’s soft, fluffy, and plush—making you feel like you’re sleeping on a five-star hotel bed. ✔ TEMPERATURE SMART + ADDS A LAYER OF PROTECTION: Our king size mattress topper disperses body heat and maintains an optimal temperature. It keeps you cool and super breathable, unlike memory foam, gel, and deluxe mattress pads. Great for hot sleepers who suffer from night sweats. It’s also a great mattress protector and repels water, stains, and spills. The liquid doesn’t seep through and keeps the mattress fresh and brand new. ✔ EXTRA DEEP POCKETS & SNUG ELASTIC FOR A PERFECT FIT: The top layer of our matress cover is made from soft-quilted, high-quality 100% cotton, and the bottom layer has a down-alternative filling for cushion padding. Made with extra deep pockets and all-around elastic, our firm mattress topper king stretches wide and far for a perfect fit. The pillow top mattress topper king measures 78” W x 80” L + 18” deep pocket and can hold up to 8-21 inches matressess easily. ✔ HOME CARE & WASH – RETAINS SHAPE EVEN AFTER 100+ WASHES: Other mattress pads become deformed or lumpy after a couple of washes. Our luxury pillowtop mattress topper retains its shape and bounce even after 100+ washes. It’s machine washable and maintains the fill consistency. Take it out from the vacuum box, place it open for a few hours, let it fluff up to shape, and then use it. Pro tip: Use fitted sheets on the mattress topper to prolong the life of the pad. ✔ 60 NIGHTS FREE TRIAL; 5-YEAR WARRANTY: Our cooling mattress topper king sets are made in a certified facility for defect-free, safe, and non-toxic products. Since our premium topper is made from 100% cotton, it’s natural, skin-friendly, and best for people with sensitive skin. We offer a 60-day free trial and 5-year warranty so that you can buy our bedding products on Amazon risk-free. If you have any other issues, you can always reach out to us, and we will resolve them immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lX3ZOOmpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THREAD SPREAD","source_asin":"B0C1YR4R7P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-386070","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1YR4R7P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1YR4R7P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
