window.products.push({"id":386330,"name":"Fryer For Home Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+U9f+AY5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ABOUT COLOR MEFlatware is an important utensil in our daily life. A set of high-quality silverware can enhance your daily dining experience. We have been committed to the design, production and of various stainless steel silverware for many years, hoping to provide each customer with healthy, safe and diverse style tableware and kitchenware.FEATURES OF PRODUCT1. VISUAL OIL TEMPERATURE GAUGEIt will help you effectively control the temperature in the pan and meet the requirements for frying different foods.2. OIL DRIP RACK LIDThe reflux groove design allows the oil to flow back into the pot, saving oil and reducing the intake of grease.3. REMOVABLE POT COVERThe top cover of the pot can be removed for easier cleaning and draining of used cooking oil.4. DIVERSION POT SIDEThere is a diversion port on one side of the pot body to make the oil draining more smoothly.5. 45 Degree INNER ROLL COVERWhen you are frying food, it can effectively prevent hot oil from splashing out.6. HOLLOW ANTI-SCALDING HANDLEIt can effectively isolate the heat, so when you pick it up, you are not afraid of burning your hands.SIZEColor: rainbowdeep fryer: 13.39in(length)*5.51in(height)*37.99oz(weight)strainer clip: 11.22in(length)*3.94in(diameter)*1.98oz(weight)USING INSTRUCTIONS1. Please wash the stainless steel fryer pot with warm soapy water before first use to make sure no manufacture residue.2. Please DO NOT use a wire brush or any hard sponge to clean tempura pan to keep its smooth surface.3. Please clean and dry the tempura fryer after use, and store it in a dry place to ensure its durability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+U9f+AY5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Color ME!","source_asin":"B09BKM3DDZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-386330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BKM3DDZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BKM3DDZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
