window.products.push({"id":386570,"name":"TriGear Professional Aluminum Culinary Refillable Adjustable Butane Lighter Torch for Cooking Welding and Soldering","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+oLmQVQuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package Includes: 1 - TriGear Professional Aluminum Culinary Refillable Adjustable Butane Lighter Torch for Cooking Welding and Soldering SAFE: With your safety in mind, the TriGear Butane Torch comes with an adjustable gas flow control and flame lock function with a stay-on button. The ridged ergonomic grip allows you to handle the torch comfortably, safely, and securely. **NOTE: Butane is NOT included with product. STURDY AND POWERFUL: With its Piezo ignition and refillable butane gas tank, the butane-powered torch has an 80-minute run time and burns at up to 1300ºF. To enhance the sturdiness of the torch, we have made the product out of one piece of solid aluminum that the tank sits in. MULTIPURPOSE: The TriGear Butane Torch is the perfect culinary tool to take care of your cooking, searing, and glazing needs. The torch can be used in caramelizing crme brulee, baking other desserts, roasting red peppers, and more. Useful outside of the kitchen as well, use your Butane Torch for welding, soldering, brazing, camping, jewelry crafting, and repairs. CUSTOMER FIRST: TriGear is constantly looking for ways to enhance your lifestyle with quality and affordable products because we believe in lower prices and higher standards. We are confident that our product will meet or exceed your expectations. Product comes with the TriGear Brand Guarantee and a 1-Year Warranty against manufacturing defects. If you are not satisfied with the product, however, we readily offer a 30-Day Hassle-Free Money Back Guarantee. Customer satisfaction is our priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+oLmQVQuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TriGear","source_asin":"B01MFGL2KI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-386570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MFGL2KI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MFGL2KI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
