window.products.push({"id":386612,"name":"Third Eye Export Indian Medallion Duvet Coverlet Tapestry/Hippie Mandala Bohemian Cotton Bedding Comforter Set/Traditional Floral Print Quilt Blanket ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HQX07k-JL._AC_.jpg","description":"Research proves you get a better night's sleep on cotton bedding, because cotton is breathable and doesn't retain odors like oil-based fabrics, cotton naturally allows your skin to breathe and doesn't trap heat under the covers. Cotton breathes better than synthetic fabrics like polyester, so it's the perfect thing to cover when you’re sleeping. Brighten up your home with this sheet set from Third Eye Export. Enjoy & wrap up yourself in these carefully crafted 100% cotton cozy Duvet sets that are expertly manufactured for durability & luxury bedding. One of the easily and most comfortable ways to quickly update the style of your bedroom is to change the bedding. With duvet covers you can change the look of your bed and room without having to completely redecorate. The set’s duvet cover adds an extra layer of cozy warmth for enhanced comfort throughout the year, from one season to the next. Enjoy an Experience of a true luxury and a cool comfortable night's sleep with exceptionally thin breathable Duvet Cover that have a silky soft feel and a lustrous finish. There is nothing quite as invigorating for a bedroom than a new duvet cover with a fresh, modern print. From classic to contemporary and traditional to eccentric show off your personal style with a unique duvet cover and make a statement. Our duvet covers comes in a variety of prints and patterns that will freshen up your bedroom or make thoughtful gifts. You’ll find yourself getting a restful night of sleep on our comfortable duvet covers. Give the color a dull room needs, our beautifully and well-designed duvet cover set adds brightness and style to your home. Each Duvet Cover has its unique imperfections. In some cases what printers would call registration errors are intentionally included on the screen print to simulate hand woodblock prints.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HQX07k-JL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Third Eye Export","source_asin":"B01M2YU9OQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-386612","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M2YU9OQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M2YU9OQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
