window.products.push({"id":386618,"name":"Custom Table Runner with Your Logo and Text (24x60in)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KOJGl-LmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Please read the text below before purchasing your custom table runner. A perfect Custom Table Runner accessory to add to your event display. How to order Custom Your Photo and Text : 1- Choose size.2- Click on \"Customise Now\" for personalisation. 3- Choose fabric color.4- Input front,top image or text.（optional） -- ➤ Polyester Table Runner Table runner custom design are made from thick, soft, polar 100% polyester heavyweight for high-quality. Custom logo tablecloth full exceptional color print is long-lasting and resists fading, preserving your photos for a lifetime. -- ➤ We will ship your custom table Runner order after 1-2 business days AFTER your print approval from Florida. -- ➤ You need to send us a high quality logo! If you don't have a file in a good resolution. Image Quality vs Print Quality: We always suggest you provide us the best quality image or logo that you have or as mentioned above. We prefer 300 DPI Resolution or 3000x3000 Pixels/inch Size image or logo for best quality print. The print quality depends on the image quality. If you cannot provide us as mentioned above, we will use whatever size or resolution you provided, we will try to enhance the quality as much we can, but if your provided logo is not the same as we request, and thus the print quality drop then we will not be accounted for this. We will notify you if we find the image is not workable or fuzzy or blurry. We seek your approval before we start production. Please Follow the personalization instructions. Place provided, we will try to enhance the quality as much we can, but if your provided logo is not the same as we request, and thus the print quality drop then we will not be accounted for this. We will notify you if we find the image is not workable or fuzzy or blurry. We seek your approval before we start production. Please Follow the personalization instructions. Place your order, and specify what color table runner you want, if not specified the runner will come white.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KOJGl-LmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grants prints","source_asin":"B09JM8JN6N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-386618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JM8JN6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JM8JN6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
