window.products.push({"id":386944,"name":"Portable Waist Clip Fan 10000mAh, Camping Fan with Solar Panel and LED Lights,4 in 1 Rechargeable USB Fan 6500RPM Strong Airflow 3 Speeds,Personal Nec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-KRLc+maL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️【Portable Fan Rechargeable】Born for the summer outdoors. The portable waist fan has been innovatively improved to next generation, it contains a solar panel and supports not only USB charging but also solar energy conversion. You never have to worry about power outages. Just remove the shirt clip, align the snaps and install the solar panel to charge it in the sun. The LED power indicator is red, indicating that the solar panel has been successfully installed. ❄️【Waist Clip Fan + Neck Fan】Specially designed with dual clips.You can easily clip it on the belt(included), T-shirt or pants firmly and enjoy cooling breeze from inner / outside. The smaller clip is removable. Equipped with an additional necklace strap, not only can be worn around the neck, free your hands when working but also can be used as a table fan. There will be no more troubles of sweating all over your back! This design is very beneficial for outdoor activities in summer. ❄️【Ultra Strong Airflow】With Latest upgraded high-efficiency 6500rpm brushless motor, the shirt fan blows 10m/s strong wind which is powerful than similar usb fan and takes away your body heat in seconds. Advanced technology avoids overheating after long time working. There're 3 speeds to adjust the air volume at ease. Press the power button once to display the power, press it again, twice, and three times for low-grade, mid-grade, and high-grade wind. Long press to turn on the LED lights. ❄️【Long Working Time & Unique Power Supply Feature】Built-in 10000mAh rechargable battery which enables you enjoy up to 24 hours cooling fresh air. Longer times can be achieved when you install solar panels. Unique charging block function, you can enjoy camping or fishing while charging your phone. It supports 2A fast charging through wall chargeer, laptop and other USB-enable devices. This undershirt fan will be a helpful gadget in summer hot flashes. ❄️【Shock Absorption & Multipurpose】Wrapped with premium TPU material, portable neck fan is shock absorption and fall-proof. Ideal for office working, camping, hiking, fishing, cycling, driving, delivering, beach, gardening, workout, etc. Best gadgets to save you from hot flashes, it will helps you refresh your mind. Perfect cooling gift for your family, friends, kids, love ones.【What You Get】(1) Portable Mini Waist Fan; (2)USB Cable; (3) Lanyard; (4) Belt Strap; (5) Solar Panel;(6) User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-KRLc+maL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amailtom","source_asin":"B09YN9LTRF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-386944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YN9LTRF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YN9LTRF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
